WEBVTT

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:01.847
that we're going to begin to see

00:20:01.871 --> 00:20:06.029
the liberating, nourishing,
deeper solutions.

00:20:07.133 --> 00:20:11.206
The cows that are waiting all around us.

00:20:11.585 --> 00:20:12.766
Thank you.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:16.478
(Applause)